Kitten4(.bcm4) -> Godot 4 converter.
IMPORTANT: read AGENTS.md first. The repo layout is messy; the only live
implementation lives in 新版本/. Skip _backup/_out/_cache/_shots (gitignored).
Read 技术路线汇报.md then 新版本/README.md before touching code.
core.js (163KB) and emit.js (143KB) are huge - locate first, never read whole.
Verify with: cd 新版本; pwsh -File _dev\regress.ps1
New .ps1 files MUST be saved as UTF-8 with BOM.

WORKS: simple projects convert well; multi-screen/screen-switching is supported.
KNOWN GAPS:
  1. broadcast/广播 triggering is unreliable
  2. pen layer vs sprite layer ordering is wrong
  3. sprite collision is not implemented
  4. physics is not implemented
  5. large games run very slowly (severe performance problems)
Items 1-4 mean implementing NEW capability - confirm design intent before
guessing semantics. Item 5 needs actual profiling by whoever picks it up;
the author is a single person with limited time and the specific bottlenecks
are NOT yet identified. Use the 16 .bcm4 files in 测试用例/ to reproduce
(广播测试, 画笔图层与印章测试, 精灵战争...).

Framework by Gwier, implemented with DeepSeek Harness.
Contributions welcome.
